translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "A kiss? ...Fine. But you're going to lose."
    new "¿Un beso? ...Está bien. Pero vas a perder."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "You're on. Don't get your hopes up."
    new "Trato hecho. No te hagas ilusiones."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "A kiss? You'll have to beat me first. Good luck with that."
    new "¿Un beso? Primero tendrás que ganarme. Buena suerte con eso."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Easy money. You're on."
    new "Dinero fácil. Trato hecho."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Deal. Hope you brought your wallet."
    new "Trato. Espero que hayas traído la cartera."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "You're betting against me? I'll gladly take that money."
    new "¿Apuestas contra mí? Con gusto me quedo con ese dinero."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Again? My lungs need a break. Tomorrow."
    new "¿Otra vez? Mis pulmones necesitan un descanso. Mañana."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "One contest a day. Come back tomorrow."
    new "Un reto al día. Vuelve mañana."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Fine... a deal's a deal."
    new "Está bien... un trato es un trato."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Okay, you won. Come here."
    new "Bueno, ganaste. Ven aquí."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Not bad. Alright, you earned it."
    new "Nada mal. Bueno, te lo ganaste."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Guess you'll have to earn that kiss some other way."
    new "Supongo que tendrás que ganarte ese beso de otra forma."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Ha! No kiss for you."
    new "¡Ja! No hay beso para ti."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Weak lungs. Come back when you can keep up."
    new "Pulmones débiles. Vuelve cuando puedas seguirme el ritmo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Ugh. Fine, here's your money."
    new "Agh. Está bien, aquí tienes tu dinero."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "I can't believe I lost. Take it."
    new "No puedo creer que perdí. Tómalo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "...You got lucky. Take it before I change my mind."
    new "...Tuviste suerte. Tómalo antes de que cambie de opinión."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Pay up~"
    new "A pagar~"

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Thanks for the donation."
    new "Gracias por la donación."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Told you. Hand it over."
    new "Te lo dije. Dámelo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "You're broke? Forget it. Winning is enough."
    new "¿Estás sin un peso? Olvídalo. Con ganar me basta."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "A tie? No way. Rematch next time."
    new "¿Empate? No puede ser. Revancha la próxima vez."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:75
    old "Nobody wins? That's so lame. Next time."
    new "¿Nadie gana? Qué aburrido. La próxima vez."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:118
    old "Bet you can't hold your breath longer than me."
    new "Apuesto a que no puedes aguantar la respiración más que yo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:118
    old "Breath-holding contest. You and me, right now."
    new "Concurso de aguantar la respiración. Tú y yo, ahora mismo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:169
    old "All those laps are paying off. You feel stronger. {b}Max Energy up!{/b} (Max Energy: %d/5)"
    new "Todas esas vueltas en la piscina están dando frutos. Te sientes más fuerte. {b}¡Energía Máxima aumentó!{/b} (Energía Máxima: %d/5)"

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:173
    old "Holding your breath under water is getting easier. {b}Breath up!{/b} (Breath: %d/%d)"
    new "Aguantar la respiración bajo el agua es cada vez más fácil. {b}¡Aliento aumentó!{/b} (Aliento: %d/%d)"

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:216
    old "If I win, you owe me a kiss."
    new "Si gano, me debes un beso."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:219
    old "Loser pays $%d."
    new "El que pierda paga $%d."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:226
    old "You both take a deep breath and sink under the water."
    new "Ambos toman aire profundo y se hunden bajo el agua."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:229
    old "She bursts up first, gasping for air. You win."
    new "Ella sale primero, jadeando por aire. Ganas tú."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:231
    old "Your lungs give out first. You surface, coughing. She wins."
    new "Tus pulmones ceden primero. Sales a la superficie tosiendo. Gana ella."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:233
    old "You both burst up at the same time."
    new "Ambos salen a la superficie al mismo tiempo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:247
    old "She hands you {b}$%d{/b}."
    new "Te entrega {b}$%d{/b}."

    # game/scripts/Actions/swimming.rpy:250
    old "You hand her {b}$%d{/b}."
    new "Le entregas {b}$%d{/b}."

